+ * names gpi_dmac00000_gpii1 as this SE's channel). Registers and the command
+ * model follow Linux drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c; the I2C TRE layout follows
+ * drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-geni.c. Polled: no GPII interrupt is enabled;
+ * channel state is read from CNTXT_0, transfers complete via the event ring.
+ *
+ * The engine masters through the apps SMMU (iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x7b6 0>);
+ * a stage-1 bypass context bank (translation off, as ABL leaves its own
